{"speciesId":345,"names":{"fr":"Lilia","es":"Lileep","en":"Lileep","ja":"リリーラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LILEEP became extinct approximately a hundred million years ago. This ancient POKéMON attaches itself to a rock on the seafloor and catches approaching prey using tentacles shaped like flower petals."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LILEEP is an ancient POKéMON that was regenerated from a fossil. It remains permanently anchored to a rock. From its immobile perch, this POKéMON intently scans for prey with its two eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It disguises itself as seaweed by making its tentacles sway. Unsuspecting prey that come too close are swallowed whole. It became extinct 100 million years ago."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It became extinct roughly 100 million years ago. It was regenerated from a fossil using advanced techniques."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It became extinct roughly 100 million years ago. It was regenerated from a fossil using advanced techniques."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It disguises its tentacles as flowers to attract and catch prey. It became extinct in ancient times."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It disguises its tentacles as flowers to attract and catch prey. It became extinct in ancient times."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vivait au fond de la mer il y a 100 millions d’années. La science a permis de le ressusciter."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vivait au fond de la mer il y a 100 millions d’années. La science a permis de le ressusciter."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il attrape ses proies avec ses tentacules-pétales. Il a disparu il y a cent millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se extinguió hace 100 millones de años. Sus tentáculos parecen pétalos para atraer a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It disguises its tentacles as flowers to attract and catch prey. It became extinct in ancient times."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"触手を 花びらに 見せかけて 近寄ってきた 獲物を 捕らえる。 １億年前に 絶滅した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vivait au fond de la mer il y a 100 millions d’années. La science a permis de le ressusciter."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vivió en los fondos marinos hace unos 100 millones de años y fue recreado científicamente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"およそ １億年前の 海底で 暮らしていた 古代の ポケモン。 科学の 力で 復活した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"L’espèce des Lilia s’est éteinte il y a environ 100 millions d’années. Cet ancien Pokémon s’accroche à un rocher, sous l’eau, et attrape ses proies à l’aide de ses tentacules en forme de pétales de fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los Lileep se extinguieron hace unos cien millones de años aproximadamente. Este Pokémon se ancla a una roca en el fondo del mar y atrapa a las presas que se le acercan con los tentáculos que tiene en forma de pétalos de flor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lileep became extinct approximately a hundred million years ago. This ancient Pokémon attaches itself to a rock on the seafloor and catches approaching prey using tentacles shaped like flower petals."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"約 １億年前に 絶滅した ポケモン。 海底の 岩に くっつき 花びらの ような 触手で 寄ってきた 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lilia est un Pokémon très ancien ressuscité à partir d’un fossile. Il reste en permanence fixé à un rocher. Ce Pokémon balaie l’horizon depuis son perchoir, immobile, en quête de proies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lileep es un Pokémon antiguo que se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Siempre está anclado a una roca. Desde su percha inmóvil está al acecho y pendiente de que no se le escape su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lileep is an ancient Pokémon that was regenerated from a fossil. It remains permanently anchored to a rock. From its immobile perch, this Pokémon intently scans for prey with its two eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"化石から 再生した 古代の ポケモン。 岩に くっつき 歩く ことが できない。 ２つの 目で じっと 獲物を 探している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il vivait déjà dans les mers chaudes il y a fort longtemps. Il imite les algues pour masquer sa présence et gobe toute proie qui l’approche."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Habitaba en los cálidos mares de antaño. Se hace pasar por alga marina, espera al acecho de su presa y la engulle cuando esta se acerca."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"In ancient times, it lived in warm seas. It disguised itself as seaweed to ambush its prey and devoured them whole when they got close."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"古代の 暖かい 海に いた。 海草に 化け 獲物を 待ち伏せ 近寄ったところを 丸呑みにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il s’accroche aux rochers grâce à ses ventouses puissantes. Une fois fixé, aucun courant marin, aussi violent soit-il, ne peut l’en déloger."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus potentes ventosas le permiten aferrarse firmemente a las rocas, de tal manera que ni una violenta marejada consigue arrastrarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sticks to rocks with its powerful suckers and can’t be washed away no matter how rough the surf gets."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"強力な 吸盤で 岩に 張り付いているので どんな 荒波でも 流されないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Reconstitué à partir d’un fossile, ce Pokémon vivait dans les mers chaudes il y a environ 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Habitaba en los mares cálidos hace unos cien millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. Lileep once lived in warm seas that existed approximately 100,000,000 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"化石から 復元した ポケモン。 およそ １億年前の 温かい 海に 生息していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Accroché aux rochers des profondeurs, il attend qu’une proie s’approche de lui pour l’attraper avec ses tentacules en forme de pétales."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se ancla a una roca en el lecho marino y atrapa a las presas que se le acercan con sus tentáculos en forma de pétalos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Lileep clings to rocks on the seabed. When prey comes close, this Pokémon entangles it with petallike tentacles."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"海底の 岩に 貼りつき 獲物が 近くにくると 花びらのような 触手で 絡めとる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":345,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","lear